{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Astella shivers, wrapping their wings around themself, tail almost tying them snug, *Will I ever be as powerful as Lorenzo? As loved as Cosimo? Is this the end of us? The people hate us, without knowledge of what we represent. I’m not in Florence. I never will be again. But this is all I know. I want to help my people, but these aren’t my people. God, the almighty, if you truly are real, how do I go on? What can I possibly do to remedy this?* They’re on their knees, hands clasped in the dim light of the driftglobe. They summon the driftglobe to their hand, holding it within their palms and watching them glow reddish from the light as tears start to waningly fall, *Why is this me? Why can’t I be a good person? Like that man at the store? Why must I make myself hated?*","created_at":"2020-07-24T04:25:24.627000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736076547760586764","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
