{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"They sit down, pulling their knees to their chest on the edge of the dock. “I’m a Duke. Or a duchess. A *Grand* Duke. And it’s so *shitty*. Do you know what that title gives me? It gives me power to subvert and oppress others. Nobody deserves oppression, yet the system we live in is built on it. I was born into a family called Medici. Generations ago, we were just a bank. Cosimo, my great-something grandfather, united us and lead to our ascension into the aristocracy. I idolize him. We once stood against oppression - or at least I thought we did. Now, we embody it. How times have changed, huh? I try to help but I can’t get over this entitled snobbery that has been down within me from my birth. I was born female, meaning my younger brother inherited the throne when my father passed. He was ten, and stupid. That’s when I realized that we’d lost our identity. We were once wise, charismatic leaders, intelligent, skilled artisans, and strong, tough warriors, and now, we’ve become foolish children who sit on pots of gold. I’m ashamed my brother - my *whole family* drags the name that our great ancestors forged. I want to make a change but I feel powerless to bring it about. I’m not the heir, and I never will be, not in technicality. This is the only chance I get at a new life, and I’ve already ruined it by name and reputation alone. I’ll never be enough...”","created_at":"2020-07-24T04:49:16.658000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736082554133938217","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"I understand none of the 'civilised' things. Family is a strong bond, but evil is evil no matter where you find it. Power over others is part of nature. So if it eases your mind: you hold little sway with me or where we are about to voyage, but until then the only burden you carry is how your power will be used.\" (Doing my best to rp 14 wis 9 charisma.)","created_at":"2020-07-24T04:55:23.602000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-24T04:57:03.840000Z","id":"736084093208625255","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"(Doing great)","created_at":"2020-07-24T04:56:08.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736084279477403750","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"“People hate me. Almost everyone does, and it makes me wonder if this new life is worth it. Should I just give myself up and spend my life in prison, atoning for my ‘heresy’ with the Roman Inquisition? Should I just end it here, tie myself to a stone?”","created_at":"2020-07-24T04:58:14.101000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736084808333262880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
